"code": "def merge_sorted(list1, list2):\n    merged_list = []\n    i, j = 0, 0\n    while i < len(list1) and j < len(list2):\n        if list1[i] < list2[j]:\n            merged_list.append(list1[i])\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            merged_list.append(list2[j])\n            j += 1\n    merged_list += list1[i:]\n    merged_list += list2[j:]\n    return merged_list",
